{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在民國99年的《國土空間發展策略計畫》中，主張將原來由臺北市、新北市與基隆市構成的區域\n生活圈擴大，進一步納入宜蘭縣。此一主張最可能和下列哪項因素造成的空間關連改變有關？", "options": {"A": "知識經濟", "B": "交通革新", "C": "工業連鎖", "D": "人口轉型"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 100.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 87.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 95.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 87.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 98.0, 96.0, 81.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "土壤的發育是土質、氣候、水文、地形、植生等環境要素綜合作用的結果。其中黑鈣土分布的地\n理環境，最可能具有下列哪兩項特色？\n甲、夏暖冬冷，草類一歲一枯榮； 乙、全年氣候溫和，草類終年繁茂；\n丙、年雨量略少於年可能蒸發散量； 丁、土壤透水性差，降雨聚積於表土；\n戊、坡度較大，有利於雨季時的排水。", "options": {"A": "甲丙", "B": "甲戊", "C": "乙丁", "D": "乙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 40.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 54.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 27.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 27.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 40.0, "p_high": 54.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [59.0, 45.0, 39.0, 32.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "進行地理實察，若欲使用全球衛星定位系統（GPS）進行位置測定，下列何種環境條件最可能影\n響訊號接收而「無法」定位？", "options": {"A": "星空籠罩的平原", "B": "森林茂密的山谷", "C": "雲霧繚繞的山峰", "D": "風勢強勁的台地"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 61.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 65.0, 59.0, 54.0, 48.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "表(一)為臺灣本島六座國家公園管理處的橫麥卡托投影二度分帶座標。其中哪三個國家公園園區\n內有照片(一)中野生動物的活動？\n表(一)\nX座標 Y座標\n甲 305216 2783145\n乙 227404 2427884\n丙 163091 2543768\n丁 237676 2704896\n戊 234746 2634355\n己 313167 2672604 照片(一)", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "乙丙丁 ( C)丙丁戊", "D": "丁戊己"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 60.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 80.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 39.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 71.0, 61.0, 51.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "近年來，一些國家因人口結構快速轉變，使工作年齡人口相較於受撫養人口快速成長，且受過良\n好教育，將有利於經濟發展，成為「人口機會窗」。人口機會窗通常出現在人口轉型階段的哪個\n階段？", "options": {"A": "高穩定階段", "B": "低穩定階段", "C": "早期擴張階段", "D": "晚期擴張階段"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 49.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 71.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 27.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 60.0, 48.0, 38.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "我國是世界重要的面板製造地，國內面板產業的上、下游廠商，主要分布於科學工業園區及其周\n圍地區，因此能夠有效降低上、下游廠商間的交易成本，強化臺灣面板生產的競爭力。此種產業\n發展現象，最適合以下列哪兩個概念加以說明？\n甲、垂直分工； 乙、水平分工； 丙、工業慣性； 丁、聚集經濟。", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "甲丁", "C": "乙丙", "D": "丙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 90.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 78.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 78.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 96.0, 93.0, 89.0, 72.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "2013年，臺灣經濟部曾赴美國「灣區」(The Bay Area)進行招商，邀請海外科技公司、企業到臺\n灣投資，強調「臺灣非常注重智慧財產權，尤其科技業有著便捷的產業供應鏈，是研發、創新最\n好的地方。」臺灣經濟部招商的地點，最可能位於下列哪個都會帶內？", "options": {"A": "達拉斯－休士頓都會帶", "B": "芝加哥－匹茲堡都會帶", "C": "舊金山－聖地牙哥都會帶", "D": "波士頓－華盛頓特區都會帶\n- 1 -\n102年指考 第 2 頁\n地理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 54.0, "D": 23.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 34.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 54.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 37.0, "discrimination": 33.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 62.0, 54.0, 44.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "美國甲公司研發的平板電腦問世後，在全球造成搶購風潮，生產線不及出貨的消息時有所聞。臺\n灣某消費者在甲公司的網路商店訂購了一台平板電腦，幾天後，他利用該網路商店的貨件追蹤查\n詢功能，得到表(二)的結果。下列哪個說法最可解釋表(二)的現象？\n表(二)\n運送編號：541368169 出貨日期：07 Feb 2011 目的地：臺灣臺北\n日期 時間 地點 貨件狀態\n07 Feb 2011 18:20:01 中國成都 出貨\n07 Feb 2011 20:23:22 中國成都 轉運中\n08 Feb 2011 23:38:00 香港 轉運站收件\n09 Feb 2011 03:53:21 香港 轉運中\n10 Feb 2011 09:21:14 桃園-海關 等待入關檢查\n10 Feb 2011 16:15:35 桃園-海關 海關檢查結束\n11 Feb 2011 07:12:26 臺北 轉運中", "options": {"A": "重視產品技術研發", "B": "降低物流運輸成本", "C": "趨向產品的標準化", "D": "減少資金流通障礙"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 83.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 65.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 81.0, 77.0, 72.0, 60.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "中國避免油輪通過麻六甲海峽時遭受到安全威脅，因此和那個陸上鄰國合作，建立經由該國海港\n通往中國的油管？", "options": {"A": "緬甸", "B": "越南", "C": "寮國", "D": "泰國"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 41.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 58.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 30.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 41.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [64.0, 46.0, 35.0, 30.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "2006年，非洲綠色革命聯盟成立，其宗旨為促進水利設施、改良土壤品質、研發適應非洲氣候的\n種子，並提供農民更良好的訓練，以增加糧食作物生產，解決非洲飢餓問題。該組織在非洲的農\n業地區推動綠色革命，需要克服下列哪項問題？", "options": {"A": "非洲境內降水量少，蒸發量大，灌溉水源不易取得", "B": "非洲農村勞力不足，無法採取精耕技術的農作方式", "C": "非洲居民大多貧窮，通常缺乏現金購買種子和肥料", "D": "跨國企業壟斷非洲農業生產，導致糧食大量地出口"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 44.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 45.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 24.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 64.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 45.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 57.0, 45.0, 31.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在歐洲人抵達美洲之前，美洲已有發展數千年的文明。下列\n哪個文明發源於如照片(二)所代表的自然景觀帶中？", "options": {"A": "印加文化", "B": "馬雅文化", "C": "伊努特文化", "D": "阿茲特克文化\n照片(二)"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 22.0, "B": 52.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 16.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 38.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [75.0, 58.0, 48.0, 41.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "表(三)是中國某都市 1982-2010 年幼年人口與老年人口分別佔總人 口比例的變遷。影響該都市\n2000年後老年人口比變遷的原因，與下列哪種現象關係最密切？\n表(三)\n1982 年 1990 年 2000 年 2010 年\n幼年人口比 18.2 18.2 12.3 8.6\n老年人口比 7.4 9.4 11.5 10.1", "options": {"A": "人口政策強調晚婚與晚育", "B": "人口成長出現少子化現象", "C": "人口戶籍受城鄉分離限制", "D": "人口大量移入至都市地區"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 62.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 51.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 30.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 73.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 13.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 21.0, "p_high": 30.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [34.0, 24.0, 19.0, 16.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "近年來，一些國家開發生質能源以替代石化燃料。其中美國與巴西，分別以哪種作物作為產製生\n質能源的主要原料？", "options": {"A": "玉米、甘蔗", "B": "大豆、甘蔗", "C": "大豆、小麥", "D": "玉米、小麥\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 102年指考\n共 7 頁 地理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 66.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 81.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 44.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 34.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 81.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 79.0, 73.0, 61.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
