{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1950-1990年代，臺灣西南部沿海地區許多居民罹患烏腳病，此種疾病的發生與當地居民的生活環\n境有關。但在下列哪項措施實行後，烏腳病的發生率即顯著降低？", "options": {"A": "大量噴灑除蟲藥劑", "B": "掃除易積水的容器", "C": "提高自來水普及率", "D": "接種新型抗菌疫苗"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 92.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 79.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 92.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 79.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 96.0, 92.0, 72.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
