{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "上述書籍所提到的南亞國家，因具有下列哪兩項優越區位條件，使得近來成為許多科技產業的外\n包工作地點？\n甲、豐富農礦資源； 乙、鄰近先進國家； 丙、消費人口眾多；\n丁、英語為官方語言； 戊、高素質人力資源。", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "甲戊", "C": "丙丁", "D": "丁戊\n- 3 -\n102年指考 第 4 頁\n地理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "19-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 62.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 82.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 75.0, 63.0, 52.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "上述書籍所陳述的兩段內容，最能夠反映出下列哪種全球現象？", "options": {"A": "在全球經濟架構下，中國因寬頻使用有限，使經濟發展趨向邊緣化", "B": "在全球環境尺度下，陸地起伏相對不明顯，所以可被視為是平坦的", "C": "在全球國際分工下，各地經貿關係的密切，使個人或企業競爭激烈", "D": "在全球暖化影響下，海水上升將淹沒耕地，導致各國面臨糧食危機"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "19-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 98.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 98.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 95.0, "discrimination": 4.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 99.0, 99.0, 93.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
