{"item_uid": "指考102-geography-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 102, "year_ce": 2013, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 36, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖(六)是綜合世界部分國家農業經營特色，所劃分\n而成的四種農業型態，包括亞洲型、歐洲型、非洲\n型、新大陸型（北美洲與大洋洲）。文中債務問題\n嚴重的國家，其農業經營最可能是圖(六)中的哪個\n型態？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "36-38", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 29.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 50.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 38.0, 28.0, 21.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
